<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-B. Stearns cuts Times Mirror.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-B. Stearns cuts Times Mirror.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns cut its rating of Times Mirror Co to neutral from attractive, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Times Mirror's share price dropped 1/8 to 53 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Bear Stearns also cut its rating on Hollinger International Inc to attractive from buy, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- Hollinger's share price dropped 1/2 to 11-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
</text>
